#question(title: [Quick composition], centered: true)[
  Let $f$ and $g$ be differentiable functions
  and let $h = f circle.small g$.  \
  What is $h^prime (2)$?
  + $f^prime (2) circle.small g^prime (2)$
  + $f^prime (2) g^prime (2)$
  + $f^prime (g(2)) g^prime (2)$
  + $f^prime (g(x)) g^prime (2)$
]
